  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧). The person/thing being mocked takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧.\n\nFORMS:\n- {嘲|あざけ}り - mockery, ridicule (noun)\n- ⟦{嘲笑|ちょうしょう}→嘲笑：09026_choushou⟧ - derision, mockery (Sino-Japanese compound)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {嘲|あざけ}る - to mock, ridicule (contemptuous)\n- ⟦からかう→からかう：07353_karakau⟧ - to tease (often playful)\n- ⟦{馬鹿|ばか}→馬鹿：03574_baka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to make a fool of, look down on\n- ⟦{冷|ひ}やかす→冷やかす：11728_hiyakasu⟧ - to tease, make fun of\n\nUSAGE:\nThis word has a negative connotation, implying contempt or cruelty. It's stronger than ⟦からかう→からかう：07353_karakau⟧ (to tease).",
